#Протокол_Daemon_Integration_Tests_V1<[
Базис:
  Daemon tick делегирует в live-loop; unit tests покрывают pure functions, но workflow regression нужен fixture backlog + journal paths.
Вектор:
  Fixture backlog: ready task with done dependency, bounded targetFiles.
  Success path: runWorkGraphDaemonTickFromBacklogFile → ok=true, worker_run_finished audit, worker output succeeded.
  Blocked path: denied worker policy → tick_failed, recovery suggestion with retry advice.
  Dry-run path: schedule without worker execution (already in workGraphDaemonTick.test.mjs).
  Fixtures live under tests/fixtures/daemon-integration/; tests/workGraphDaemonIntegration.test.mjs in deterministic suite.
Цель:
  WorkGraph OS scheduler regression-safe без Playwright для MVP.

